cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Trustworthy Stock Intelligence"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Chien-Hsun Chang"
repository-code: "https://github.com/KageRyo/trustworthy-stock-intelligence"
url: "https://github.com/KageRyo/trustworthy-stock-intelligence"
license: "Apache-2.0"
version: "0.7.0"
date-released: "2026-10-07"
abstract: >-
  Research software for schema-first, human-in-the-loop stock drawdown-risk
  analysis with temporal validation, calibration, uncertainty, trust scores,
  warning explanations. Version 0.7.0 adds range-based volatility features to
  the served baseline, backed by a walk-forward feature-set experiment with a
  ticker holdout and a Taiwan check, on top of the 0.6.0 alert-rate threshold
  policies; it is not externally validated research or investment advice.
keywords:
  - stock risk
  - trustworthy AI
  - calibration
  - uncertainty estimation
  - temporal validation
  - financial machine learning
